      "refersTo": "gift-card",
      "description": "Unboxed gift details, compact missing-photo state, and an optional recipient priority independent of list order.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-gift-card\" href=\"#gift\"><div class=\"ds-photo\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.1\"><path d=\"M3 8h18v4H3zM5 12v9h14v-9M12 8v13M12 8H7.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 10 5.5L12 8Zm0 0h4.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 0 14 5.5L12 8Z\"/></svg><span>No photo yet</span></div><div class=\"ds-card-copy\"><div class=\"ds-recipient\">For Alex</div><h3>Gift title</h3><span class=\"ds-priority\">Most wanted</span><div class=\"ds-meta\"><span>$25.00</span><span class=\"ds-available\">Available</span></div></div></a>",
      "css": ".ds-gift-card{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;display:block;max-width:300px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--text, #2b201d)}.ds-photo{aspect-ratio:auto;min-height:80px;padding:12px;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;border-radius:var(--radius,14px);background:#efe7dc;color:#8b7164;display:flex;position:relative;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden}.ds-photo span{position:static;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#746057)}.ds-card-copy{padding:16px 2px 0}.ds-recipient{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted, #746057);margin-bottom:11px}.ds-gift-card h3{font-size:16px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:550;margin:0 0 9px}.ds-gift-card:hover h3{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:14px}.ds-available{font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;border-radius:4px;padding:4px 6px;background:#e9eddf;color:#486348}.ds-gift-card:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent, #aa4d37);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-priority{display:inline-flex;width:fit-content;margin:6px 0;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text,#2b201d);border:1px solid transparent;background:var(--soft,#f4e4da);font-weight:600}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Group event entry",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "One occasion with separate wish-list and event-management links, explicit sharing, and privacy.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-event-entry\"><div class=\"ds-event-heading\"><div><h3>Family celebration</h3><p>Shared with: Morgan family · 2 participants</p></div><span class=\"ds-privacy\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg>Keep it a surprise</span></div><div class=\"ds-event-links\"><a href=\"#wish-list\">Your wish list <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a href=\"#event\">Manage event <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-privacy{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid var(--border, #e6d9cf);border-radius:5px;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--muted, #746057)}.ds-event-entry{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--text,#2b201d);padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border,#e6d9cf)}.ds-event-heading{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:16px}.ds-event-heading>div{flex:1;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-event-heading h3{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:19px}.ds-event-heading p{margin:0;color:var(--muted,#746057);font-size:13px}.ds-event-links{margin-top:16px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 24px}.ds-event-links a{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;min-height:44px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent,#aa4d37);text-decoration:none}.ds-event-links a:last-child{font-size:13px;font-weight:550}.ds-event-links a:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}.ds-event-links a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#aa4d37);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobile navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-mobile",
      "description": "Five destinations with icons and labels. Shown in isolation here; the app fixes this navigation to the bottom and measures its full height for content clearance.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-mobile-nav\" aria-label=\"Sample mobile navigation\"><a href=\"#home\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg><span>Home</span></a><a href=\"#people\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><span>People</span></a><a href=\"#lists\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 5h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 12h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m3 17 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m3 7 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>My lists</span></a><a href=\"#buying\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"></path><path d=\"M3.103 6.034h17.794\"></path><path d=\"M3.4 5.467a2 2 0 0 0-.4 1.2V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6.667a2 2 0 0 0-.4-1.2l-2-2.667A2 2 0 0 0 17 2H7a2 2 0 0 0-1.6.8z\"></path></svg><span>Buying</span></a><a href=\"#exchanges\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 14 4 4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"m18 2 4 4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h1.973a4 4 0 0 0 3.3-1.7l5.454-8.6a4 4 0 0 1 3.3-1.7H22\"></path><path d=\"M2 6h1.972a4 4 0 0 1 3.6 2.2\"></path><path d=\"M22 18h-6.041a4 4 0 0 1-3.3-1.8l-.359-.45\"></path></svg><span>Exchanges</span></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-mobile-nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;padding:9px 14px calc(9px + var(--safe-area-bottom,0px));border-top:1px solid var(--border,#e6d9cf);background:var(--paper,#fffdf9);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-mobile-nav a{display:flex;flex:1;align-items:center;gap:5px;flex-direction:column;color:var(--muted,#746057);font-size:11px;padding:4px 2px;min-width:0;text-align:center;text-decoration:none}.ds-mobile-nav a[aria-current]{color:var(--accent,#aa4d37)}.ds-mobile-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#aa4d37);outline-offset:3px}.ds-mobile-nav a span{max-width:100%;overflow-wrap:anywhere}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A little thought. A lovely surprise.",
    "overview": "Little Hint is a calm place to coordinate gifts for people you know. Recipient names, gift details, prices, and availability lead. Warm paper backgrounds, quiet dividers, and open rows give those details room.\n\nThe approved heart-tag artwork carries the brand. Its outlined Fraunces lettering remains an image asset; the interface uses the established system sans stack. Light and dark themes share the same hierarchy and shapes.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Approved heart-tag artwork and outlined lettering.",
      "Ivory and umber neutrals with sienna actions and blush selection fills.",
      "Flat gift cards with recipient details directly below the image.",
      "Desktop sidebar and mobile bottom navigation."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The semantic color rule",
        "body": "Use the theme variables for interface text, controls, and backgrounds so light and dark modes preserve their roles.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The artwork rule",
        "body": "Use the supplied logo and symbol assets. Do not recreate their lettering with live text.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The flat content rule",
        "body": "Gift cards and ordinary list rows have no shadow. Reserve elevation for dialogs and transient messages.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the approved horizontal or tagline artwork and its dark variant where the component supports it.",
      "Do keep recipient, gift title, price, and visible availability together.",
      "Do contain product images and show the labeled placeholder when an image is missing or fails.",
      "Do keep the availability checkbox visible when filters wrap on small screens.",
      "Do retain visible keyboard focus, named icon controls, reduced-motion behavior, and mobile safe-area padding."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't reconstruct the logo lettering or substitute a display font for the approved artwork.",
      "Don't add shadows to ordinary gift cards or list rows.",
      "Don't use invented product photography or present demonstration fixtures as real gifts.",
      "Don't rely on color alone to explain availability or list privacy."
    ]
  }
}
